---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Catálogo de Servicios - Quintanamur S.L."
  description="Servicios agrícolas de precisión y obra civil pesada: despedregado, plantación GPS, desfonde, excavaciones y movimientos de tierra en Murcia y comarca."
  activePage="servicios"
>
  <!-- Header / Hero -->
  <header class="bg-inverse-surface text-surface py-20 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
      <div class="md:col-span-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary-fixed-dim uppercase tracking-widest block mb-3">
          Especialistas en Movimiento de Tierras y Campo
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-display-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg text-surface-bright mb-6">
          Nuestro Catálogo de Servicios
        </h1>
        <p class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-medium text-surface-container-high mb-4">
          De la preparación agrícola más extrema al movimiento de tierras más pesado.
        </p>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-surface-container mb-10 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          En Quintanamur S.L. centralizamos todas las fases de tu proyecto con maquinaria propia de última generación. Elige tu sector para descubrir cómo podemos ayudarte.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-surface text-inverse-surface font-body-md font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded hover:bg-surface-dim transition-colors duration-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-surface-bright sharp-shadow"
            href="#servicios-agricolas"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2">arrow_downward</span>
            VER SERVICIOS AGRÍCOLAS
          </a>
          <a
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-surface text-surface font-body-md font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded hover:bg-surface/10 transition-colors duration-200 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-surface-bright"
            href="#obra-civil"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2">arrow_downward</span>
            VER OBRA CIVIL Y EXCAVACIONES
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Decorative Elements -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex md:col-span-4 items-center justify-center relative opacity-20">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[180px] text-surface">agriculture</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Section 1: SERVICIOS AGRÍCOLAS -->
  <section class="bg-surface py-24 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop" id="servicios-agricolas">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-16">
        <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-primary tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Sector Primario</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">SERVICIOS AGRÍCOLAS</h2>
        <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-primary mt-4"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter mb-gutter">
        <!-- Service Card 1 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg overflow-hidden sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group">
          <div class="h-64 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              alt="Fresadora FI-IVAN y tractor Fendt triturando piedra"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCXQtf_j4EDG-BaIDYHfW8iHFM0ZhyX-GUJb1x_cP3qBLwK4JtKctRu-I7h5ENuEZtlgLxw7_dakdf47dRqW9kWzVThh0N3CRcwEY1tthwy8of9izq6eLaQ1VMXC-7Wbr0wPxSm27v8EZHKfaek-8kv10Lm-7tsZ8z8ZMrdsGvajm0rWifOmXFS_GentL2QtyRyw-jHanZfHqSbRtGk5jtli7ZTxPqR4ZJP_WqHUV7rCr_tt9qXACP8"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase">
              Preparación de Suelo
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow">
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Despedregado de Fincas y Trituración de Piedra
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 flex-grow leading-relaxed">
              Transformamos terrenos pedregosos en tierras fértiles y seguras para la siembra. Nuestra maquinaria especializada tritura roca in situ hasta 35cm de profundidad, mejorando la estructura del suelo sin necesidad de retirar material.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-surface-container p-4 rounded-md mb-6 border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-center">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mr-3 text-2xl">precision_manufacturing</span>
              <div>
                <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase block mb-1">Tecnología empleada</span>
                <span class="font-body-md text-body-md font-medium text-on-surface">Fresadora FI-IVAN + Tractor Fendt Alta Potencia</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/contacto"
              class="w-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-body-md font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors duration-200 mt-auto flex justify-center items-center text-center"
            >
              Solicitar presupuesto para triturar piedra
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-2 text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Service Card 2 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg overflow-hidden sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col group">
          <div class="h-64 overflow-hidden relative">
            <img
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              alt="Plantadora con guiado satelital GPS"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBcZRIiuDu4joh3qiF3Spgjongz8mXGSaAUe8Ds_q-xDE13poy5jChZqq5tDP_Wk1CiPHoD1Zi6tTlUp6zn8oW8k1lWDcyHzPN9Wq19CMpEtJsu5EzoUhqJagDLUJzN6tLCN7oQQx1DBo6zWA2GyK7bTGfsvt71fJK1JGjLCEPl9r9Z8V7szL2yMh9XuHHwgbbQ047txL8aifGAEyedAfU7yGNhKi34aixP_S8Afzkz2aqnJp31am87"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase">
              Plantación de Precisión
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow">
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Plantación de Viñedo y Almendros con GPS
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 flex-grow leading-relaxed">
              Establecimiento de nuevos cultivos leñosos con precisión milimétrica. Utilizamos sistemas de guiado GPS RTK para garantizar una alineación perfecta, optimizando el espacio y facilitando futuras labores mecanizadas.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-surface-container p-4 rounded-md mb-6 border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-center">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mr-3 text-2xl">satellite_alt</span>
              <div>
                <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase block mb-1">Tecnología empleada</span>
                <span class="font-body-md text-body-md font-medium text-on-surface">Plantadora TOPCOM con autoguiado GPS</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/contacto"
              class="w-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-body-md font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors duration-200 mt-auto flex justify-center items-center text-center"
            >
              Consultar disponibilidad de plantación
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-2 text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento grid for smaller services -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter">
        <!-- Service 3 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg p-8 sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface max-w-[80%]">
                Desfonde de Tierras y Preparación Profunda
              </h3>
              <div class="bg-surface-container-high p-2 rounded-full">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">landscape</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Aireación y rotura de capas compactadas profundas para mejorar el drenaje y desarrollo radicular previo a nuevas plantaciones.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-sm">build</span>
              <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Arado de volteo profundo</span>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/contacto"
              class="text-primary font-body-md font-bold flex items-center hover:text-primary-container transition-colors"
            >
              Hablar con un especialista en desfonde
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-1 text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Service 4 -->
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg p-8 sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-start justify-between mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface max-w-[80%]">
                Arranque de Viña y Limpieza de Cultivos
              </h3>
              <div class="bg-surface-container-high p-2 rounded-full">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">forest</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Eliminación eficiente de plantaciones viejas o enfermas, incluyendo la extracción de raíces y preparación inicial del terreno para su próximo uso.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-sm">build</span>
              <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Topo + Pala extractora</span>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/contacto"
              class="text-primary font-body-md font-bold flex items-center hover:text-primary-container transition-colors"
            >
              Pedir precio por hectárea para arranque
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-1 text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 2: OBRA CIVIL Y EXCAVACIONES -->
  <section class="bg-surface-variant py-24 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop border-t border-outline-variant/20" id="obra-civil">
    <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-16">
        <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary tracking-widest uppercase mb-2 block">Infraestructura &amp; Construcción</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">OBRA CIVIL Y EXCAVACIONES</h2>
        <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-secondary mt-4"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
        <!-- Main Feature Service -->
        <div class="md:col-span-8 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg overflow-hidden sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col md:flex-row group">
          <div class="md:w-1/2 h-64 md:h-auto relative overflow-hidden">
            <img
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
              alt="Excavación y movimiento de tierras con retropala"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAFN4qGOfXjN2K-80uhnHe8IZ2tIGcoOcFt9cR3vIqfVANynoSD-qevOqXsU2ulg2Uns4UZrPHgyLq6otFzu8ycA4ZGfTY-hKYfKVX7P2Tnml_NPyAsGPWw-3XNKhecRJoUXVoZRKmhx3TzMVRfk3DFIuuAKx8_brH5HpwTYUKL8A_1-B12RScw_1AhBNW9KD-6PJo6CJwBXC9_ctNheB75kzmS8f2Ue2hL7cS8XdlHg1o6zmCp8sC5"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase shadow-sm">
              Movimiento de Tierras
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="md:w-1/2 p-8 flex flex-col">
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3">
              Excavaciones, Cimentaciones y Movimiento de Tierras
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-6 flex-grow leading-relaxed">
              Ejecución precisa de excavaciones para cimentaciones profundas, zanjas para canalizaciones y grandes movimientos de tierra para preparación de plataformas y nivelaciones topográficas.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-4 rounded-md mb-6 border-l-4 border-secondary">
              <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase block mb-1">Equipo Principal</span>
              <span class="font-body-md text-body-md font-semibold text-on-surface">Retropala de Alto Rendimiento TrinityB 432</span>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/contacto"
              class="w-full border-2 border-secondary text-secondary font-body-md font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded hover:bg-secondary hover:text-on-secondary transition-colors duration-200 mt-auto flex justify-center items-center text-center"
            >
              Consultar servicios de excavación
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Side Services Column -->
        <div class="md:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-gutter">
          <!-- Service 2 -->
          <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg overflow-hidden sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col flex-grow">
            <div class="h-40 overflow-hidden relative">
              <img
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                alt="Trituradora de roca y reciclaje de áridos"
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBdxbU5EnOYYyIiXj4JpB-9mlk-t5s6b4UZ-NDs6jNKpkxuyU-S8YGqkcrh1TV6s6BMLHXVB07LHDbUDVKqMiaKdYTAPb8VhJvso2WjimsCRWGdgeWOCu42aHh9_74jabdHLtmM5RRxWj1ktW5uuz1pp3vnqfduEs4zT22pyQ5vxJt0sKBMJjgG7vAugUtrgqrS9CdmTsTHx7VKuUHwJhBwzAdLxDAb_WTCfUtDkVh3GyXrhN_5TzOr"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-grow">
              <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2 text-xl">
                Trituración de Roca y Reciclaje de Pavimentos
              </h3>
              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-4 text-sm flex-grow">
                Reducción volumétrica de materiales pedregosos y asfálticos in situ para su reutilización como base estabilizada.
              </p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-xs">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-sm">settings_suggest</span>
                <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase">FI-IVAN 2T S2 + Fendt</span>
              </div>
              <a
                href="/contacto"
                class="text-secondary font-body-md font-bold flex items-center hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Solicitar valoración técnica
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-1 text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Service 3 -->
          <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-lg p-6 sharp-shadow hover:sharp-shadow-hover transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col flex-grow">
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2 text-xl">
              Trituración de Arbolado y Desbroce Integral
            </h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-4 text-sm flex-grow">
              Limpieza profunda de parcelas forestales o urbanizables, eliminando biomasa pesada y maleza densa con equipos de alta capacidad.
            </p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-xs">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-sm">settings_suggest</span>
              <span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface-variant uppercase">Trituradora Forestal TFT Cancela</span>
            </div>
            <a
              href="/contacto"
              class="text-secondary font-body-md font-bold flex items-center hover:text-secondary-container transition-colors text-sm mt-auto"
            >
              Solicitar valoración para despeje
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-1 text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-primary-container rounded-xl p-8 md:p-12 sharp-shadow text-center relative overflow-hidden">
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none flex"
        style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 10px, #ffffff 10px, #ffffff 20px);"
      ></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-on-primary-container mb-4 block">handshake</span>
        <h2 class="font-display-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg text-on-primary-container mb-4">
          ¿Tienes un proyecto en mente?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-primary-container/90 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Evaluamos tu terreno y te ofrecemos la solución técnica más eficiente con maquinaria propia, garantizando plazos y resultados profesionales.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="tel:+34600000000"
            class="bg-on-primary-container text-primary-container font-body-md font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded hover:bg-surface transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-center shadow-md sharp-shadow"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2">call</span>
            Llamar al Teléfono Directo
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/34600000000"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="bg-transparent border-2 border-on-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-body-md font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded hover:bg-on-primary-container/10 transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined mr-2">chat</span>
            Contactar por WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
